WEBVTT

00:01:33.670 --> 00:01:38.600
They're holding a meeting of the Union Lords,
so we've been summoned to Jalucia.

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:44.140
Over six months since the Great Hall Tragedy,
and now there's finally a meeting?

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:48.060
I'm not exactly thrilled to go,
but I suppose there's no choice.

00:01:49.270 --> 00:01:53.030
Ever since that incident, everyone has had
a keen interest in your next move.

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:57.610
Perhaps it's because you aided Sir Theo
in the battle for Savis.

00:01:57.610 --> 00:02:01.160
Lord Villar has certainly earned
high praise, in my opinion

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:03.410
I don't know about that.

00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:06.790
Lord Alexis, who has since become
the leader of the Union,

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:09.170
does not wish to engage the Alliance in battle.

00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:11.960
By the way,

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:14.460
when was your birthday again?

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:27.560
Amazing. I can't believe you can
manipulate multiple targets at once!

00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:33.820
Once you get the hang of it, it's quite easy.

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:36.570
Please show me how! I'd love to learn!

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:39.990
W-Well, I suppose I don't mind.

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:41.660
Thank you very much!

00:02:56.630 --> 00:02:58.010
Understood.

00:03:00.970 --> 00:03:04.430
I'd forgotten that Margaret's
25th birthday was coming up.

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:07.520
If I may say so,

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:14.020
I'm well aware that you're always thinking
of our futures, and truly appreciate it.

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:19.900
That said, Lady Margaret would prefer
to continue being under contract to you.

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:22.030
That's a welcome thought, if true.

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:27.790
However, it wouldn't do to show
only Margaret preferential treatment.

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:32.880
Siluca.

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:37.460
I'd like you to start making preparations
for Margaret's birthday banquet right away.

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:40.380
Also, regarding the upcoming
Lords' meeting...

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:43.390
I'd like you,
Theo and Lassic to accompany me.

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:46.060
You wish to take Sir Theo as well?

00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:51.310
Federico Rossini, the Viscount of Systina,
will also be attending.

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:53.560
It wouldn't hurt for Theo to meet him.

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:55.570
Thank you for taking it into consideration.

00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:57.400
No need to thank me.

00:03:57.400 --> 00:04:02.820
I want you there to insist that
you were the ones who started that battle.

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:06.330
And that I merely lent you a helping hand.

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:07.830
Of course we will, sir.

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:09.330
I'm counting on you.

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:25.600
Lady Margaret, Happy Birthday!

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:27.720
Congratulations!

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:32.980
Thank you for looking after me.

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:35.650
Will you be returning to
your homeland after this?

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:36.480
Yes.

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:40.240
It's all so glamorous.

00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:42.490
There will be dancing afterwards, you know.

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:45.070
Are you a skilled dancer, Sir Theo?

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:48.740
Not by a long shot!
I've never even seen anyone dancing before.

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:51.750
Meletes?

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:54.670
Lady Margaret...

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:59.090
I'd like to wish you... a happy birthday.

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:03.760
What's with the long face, Siluca?

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:08.720
I had hoped to learn
so much more from you, Lady Margaret.

00:05:08.970 --> 00:05:10.310
Me, teach you?

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:12.350
But I'm Hellfire Margaret.

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:16.230
I have nothing to teach but
basic chemical spells.

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:20.280
But I still have so much to learn.

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:21.110
Siluca...

00:05:22.240 --> 00:05:25.110
You might not be a mage
under contract to Lord Villar,

00:05:25.110 --> 00:05:28.160
but you've caused him trouble,
as well as received his favor.

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:30.580
I understand that.

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:36.120
I'm counting on you to take care
of Artuk and Lord Villar.

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:33.120
Anyone can see
that they're made for each other.

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:34.870
You have a point.

00:07:35.370 --> 00:07:39.750
But as outsiders, this is one thing
we have no way of fixing.

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:41.420
Right.

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:43.920
Let's dance!

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:45.800
Huh? Are you sure about this?

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:49.670
After seeing that amazing dance,
no time like the present!

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:01.980
Sorry!

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:08.360
One... Two... Three...

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:11.360
Try to keep to this rhythm,
and move your feet in time.

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:12.740
I see.

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:17.330
Move your body... a little closer to mine.

00:08:17.950 --> 00:08:18.750
Are you sure?

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:21.790
That's what you do when you dance.

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:25.750
<i>T-Too close!</i>

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:29.550
<i>R-Right in my face!</i>

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:37.510
It looked a lot easier when I watched it.

00:08:38.520 --> 00:08:40.270
Well, it was your first time.

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:41.520
That was quite entertaining.

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:46.770
Your talent lies more in buffoonery
than in being a Lord, wouldn't you say?

00:08:47.270 --> 00:08:48.860
Even if it's as a buffoon,

00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:53.360
to earn any praise from you, Lord Milza,
would be a lifelong source of pride for me.

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:58.830
My dislike of you is confirmed.

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:01.620
Come with me.

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:10.050
Didn't think you'd bring a shield.

00:09:10.460 --> 00:09:11.970
Feel free to make the first move!

00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:15.260
That so?

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:33.570
I thought I'd cross swords with you,
but who knew you'd only defend?

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:37.200
I thought this is how I should fight.

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:40.330
This is not how a Lord should fight!

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:46.250
You can only protect yourself behind a shield.

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:50.630
By eliminating your opponents,
your allies will survive.

00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:54.010
You'll save more allies in the end.

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:56.180
And that is how...

00:09:57.470 --> 00:09:59.850
a Lord worthy of his title should fight!

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:23.750
I thank you... for your instruction.

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:28.790
All other Lords are just like you,
hence why the era of Chaos drags on.

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:32.090
Only one person can acquire
the Emperor's Crest.

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:34.760
So why not determine the victor in battle?

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:39.220
Men like you, who lack ambition
and the mettle to protect your allies,

00:10:39.220 --> 00:10:40.510
have no right to be Lords.

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:45.140
But I have a path I've sworn to follow.

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:50.270
An untold number of citizens have
lost their lives with you at the helm.

00:10:50.270 --> 00:10:52.190
And there will be many more in the future.

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:54.320
That might be true.

00:10:56.400 --> 00:10:59.910
So you strive for oppression, I see.

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:13.090
Eventually, I will serve as the fangs
of the one who becomes emperor.

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:17.970
And my hope is that Lord Villar
will turn out to be that man.

00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:24.510
I was a nervous wreck the entire time!

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:26.350
You and me both.

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:32.310
Wherever that man goes,
a pile of enemy corpses will be in his wake.

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:38.820
But it's possible I could leave
a trail of dead allies in mine.

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:40.990
That's what it means to strive for justice.

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:44.700
Though I'd rather not go down such a path.

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:50.920
Sir Theo, you have empathy for others,
and the power to fuse their souls into one.

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:54.590
In other words, the path you seek to follow,

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:59.760
was born from a desire you share with those
who suffer under the Chaos and oppression.

00:12:00.840 --> 00:12:04.510
Meaning it's not just my path to follow.

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:10.480
You'll go down that path with me, won't you?

00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:11.690
Of course!

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:21.820
Thank you very much for the splendid party.

00:12:22.860 --> 00:12:27.240
If I may speak my mind,
I wish I could've served you longer.

00:12:27.740 --> 00:12:30.160
It makes me happy to hear you say that.

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:34.500
But as you're a priestess of
the order that worships the Sacred Flame,

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:39.010
if I kept you here any longer,
I'd get an earful from Dartania's viceroy.

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:43.680
To tell the truth, I would've liked to
lean on your wisdom a bit longer.

00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:48.140
Since you're basically the only one I can consult on foreign policy...

00:12:48.140 --> 00:12:50.270
...I find myself imposing on you in spite of myself.

00:12:51.140 --> 00:12:52.640
I'm happy to hear that.

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:57.400
Regarding military and foreign policy matters,
I think you'll be able to rely on Siluca.

00:12:58.150 --> 00:13:02.070
The next Mage Leader, Laura,
is capable of handling domestic affairs.

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:04.030
Siluca, eh?

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:09.830
I wonder why she had
such an aversion to me?

00:13:12.710 --> 00:13:17.090
She ate up all the "Lustful Earl"
rumors swirling around Eramu.

00:13:17.460 --> 00:13:18.840
But that's not fair.

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:23.340
In my mind, there's no man alive
who treasures women more than I do.

00:13:24.090 --> 00:13:26.470
I find it hard to agree with that.

00:13:26.470 --> 00:13:28.100
You don't think I treasure you?

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:32.600
Or is it that you just refuse
to get seriously involved?

00:13:36.270 --> 00:13:37.480
Isn't she beautiful?

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:40.190
Lady Floria.

00:13:41.110 --> 00:13:45.610
Daughter of the man who founded the Alliance,
the Blood-and-Iron Earl, Jurgen Kreische.

00:13:46.610 --> 00:13:47.740
Yes.

00:13:47.740 --> 00:13:51.370
She married into the Constance family,
a member of the Alliance at the time.

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:57.960
However, my father, Lucien,
defected to the Union.

00:13:57.960 --> 00:14:00.340
Denied permission to return
to the Kreische clan,

00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:03.340
and filled with a fierce hatred of my father...

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:06.720
My incarcerated mother began to abuse me.

00:14:11.930 --> 00:14:14.100
My mother couldn't forgive me.

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:17.600
"You have the corrupt
Constance blood in your veins."

00:14:18.360 --> 00:14:21.780
"You are not my child," she would tell me.

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:25.240
How terrible...

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:29.490
That's my earliest memory of my mother.

00:14:32.290 --> 00:14:35.750
I came to hate my mother,
and cursed my Kreische blood.

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:38.040
And I revered my father.

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:42.880
So why do you now
feel such reverence for Lady Floria?

00:14:43.380 --> 00:14:45.380
It's not as complicated as you'd think.

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:52.390
My mother was sure that father would fear
the Kreische blood running in my veins.

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:55.390
I was told that I resembled her, you see.

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:56.890
Don't tell me...

00:14:56.890 --> 00:15:01.650
Lady Floria deliberately rejected you
so you wouldn't come to harm?

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:04.070
I'll never know the truth.

00:15:04.650 --> 00:15:07.950
But rather than despise the woman
who gave birth to you...

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:10.910
...who wouldn't prefer to love her instead?

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:14.410
Lord Villar...

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:16.790
Please, do not cry.

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:21.630
That's why I don't wish to talk on this matter.

00:15:23.670 --> 00:15:25.920
I have always loved you!

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:30.010
You were the woman I could trust
more than anyone else.

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:36.680
But, even though I worship women,
I may also fear them.

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:42.110
And the reason I could never take you
as my bride was obvious from the start.

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:47.690
All I hoped for was to remain
by your side, nothing more.

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:53.530
I'll be praying that you find happiness.

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:05.170
A meeting of the Lords will be held in Jalucia.

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:07.760
Needless to say,
we will have to attend as well.

00:16:09.090 --> 00:16:11.430
Normally, we'd travel by ship,

00:16:11.430 --> 00:16:14.510
but this time, at the suggestion of
a mage who dislikes the sea,

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:17.020
we'll be making the trip together by land.

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:24.360
In that case, I shall invite you all
to my seaside castle another time.

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:28.110
Siluca, kindly go over the plan one more time.

00:16:28.110 --> 00:16:29.110
Understood.

00:16:30.990 --> 00:16:33.910
Due to Lord Lassic's conquest of Sievis,

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:38.410
the Lords of the neighboring Forbes and Clovis
are now immensely agitated.

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:41.370
We will vanquish these two countries

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:43.420
as we make our way towards
the Union nation of Ismeia.

00:16:44.130 --> 00:16:49.010
We'll send our troops back upon arrival,
while the rest of you will head on to Jalucia.

00:16:49.380 --> 00:16:52.720
Sir Lassic, you will go to Forbes with Sir Theo,

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:55.260
while the main unit will advance into Clovis.

00:16:55.260 --> 00:16:56.260
Roger that!

00:16:56.760 --> 00:17:01.230
You'll deal with Lords who declare their intent
to remain with the Alliance in battle,

00:17:01.230 --> 00:17:05.110
and send those who wish
to join the Union to the main unit.

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:10.610
This is shaping up to be an epic stage!

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:16.120
We'll go to the Lords' meeting,
bearing Forbes and Clovis as souvenirs!

00:17:39.310 --> 00:17:42.850
We have come to align ourselves
with the Union.

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:44.980
Where is Jericho Orlick, King of Forbes?

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:48.230
He has resolved to remain with the Alliance.

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:50.230
Well, that's a bold resolution.

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:51.940
What are the other Lords up to?

00:17:52.490 --> 00:17:57.280
In the northeast, Baron Brannis,
a Lord in service to the King of Forbes,

00:17:57.280 --> 00:17:59.620
has barricaded himself in a robust castle.

00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:01.370
Brannis, huh?

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:05.040
I hear they call him
the Venomous Snake of Forbes.

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:11.380
The free Lord Baron Ladvan
has decided to side with the King of Forbes.

00:18:12.710 --> 00:18:13.550
Sir Lassic?

00:18:14.300 --> 00:18:15.260
What is it?

00:18:15.880 --> 00:18:19.680
I inquire if you would allow Sir Theo
to take care of Baron Ladvan.

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:21.430
Fine by me!

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:24.480
In that case...

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:28.100
I shall seize the castle of this
so-called Venomous Snake of Forbes.

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:30.770
Do you wish me to lend you some troops?

00:18:32.280 --> 00:18:33.780
I can manage on my own.

00:18:42.910 --> 00:18:46.410
Hand over your Crests to me,
and depart this territory without delay.

00:18:46.920 --> 00:18:48.790
You may take any fortune you can carry.

00:18:52.630 --> 00:18:55.380
However, you have
but three days to withdraw.

00:18:55.380 --> 00:18:58.970
If you remain after that deadline,
I cannot guarantee your survival.

00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:00.430
What the hell...

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:02.600
How impetuous you are!

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:05.480
Can't we discuss this in a more amicable way?

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:08.980
Like over drinks at a banquet, Union-style.

00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:11.980
I assure that my daughters will
show you the utmost hospitality.

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:16.530
Dartania is not a member of the Union.
I request your answer.

00:19:17.070 --> 00:19:22.620
True, if you're not inclined to negotiate,
talking would just be a waste of time.

00:19:25.620 --> 00:19:27.250
What is your intention?

00:19:27.250 --> 00:19:32.130
That goes without saying. I will murder you,
and take over your Crest.

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:34.000
Lord Brannis!

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:37.880
Would treating an emissary this way
violate the Lords' code?

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:40.760
You, there... What is your name?

00:19:41.760 --> 00:19:42.970
My name is Nikola.

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:48.270
Then, Nikola, I want you to witness
what is about to transpire.

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:52.270
Nothing significant will occur.

00:19:52.270 --> 00:19:56.230
Nothing but the demise
of one misguided Lord, that is!

00:20:02.030 --> 00:20:03.740
I-Impossible!

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:07.540
If you'd just handed over your Crest,
you wouldn't need to die.

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:09.000
W-Wait–

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:20.840
To kill a venomous snake, all you need to do
is stab the mouth it opens to bite you.

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:23.350
A-All at once–

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:51.670
When it's just you against a horde,

00:20:52.420 --> 00:20:55.040
it's easier to fight if they surround you.

00:20:56.630 --> 00:20:58.710
Since everyone around you is your enemy.

00:21:00.510 --> 00:21:02.010
U-Unbelievable!

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:31.710
Did you see to the end?

00:21:32.410 --> 00:21:33.580
Y-Yes.

00:21:34.170 --> 00:21:37.250
Sooner or later, the Sievis forces
will arrive to claim this castle.

00:21:38.460 --> 00:21:40.800
Be the one to relay how this came to pass.

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:44.970
I will gladly do as you say.

00:21:51.730 --> 00:21:54.640
<i>Well, I've sacked this castle all by myself...</i>

00:21:57.190 --> 00:21:58.820
<i>What will you do?</i>

00:22:00.980 --> 00:22:04.990
MARCH

00:23:34.990 --> 00:23:40.000
EPISODE 7:
THE WHITE PRINCE
